{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":60603,\"title\":\"The Curse of Oak Island\",\"tagline\":\"Connecting the dots one dig at a time.\",\"overview\":\"Follow brothers Marty and Rick Lagina through their effort to find the speculated - and as of yet undiscovered - buried treasure believed to have been concealed through extraordinary means on Oak Island.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gtkxUUmHDF31iDUOlxQqUXmiU71.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3dGIUAlrWUvPDMP7mk6GFvkQcSb.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":155,\"year\":2014,\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Reality\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":14,\"totalEpisodes\":264,\"createdBy\":[\"Kevin Burns\"],\"networks\":[\"History\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-11-10\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":6868,\"name\":\"Kevin Burns\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xGGMVmWHYzEiThXPWfC0EZI42H8.jpg\"},{\"id\":1386173,\"name\":\"Rick Lagina\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5oBE9iz5v8vcpBWnHFH1u9nQTAg.jpg\"},{\"id\":1386174,\"name\":\"Marty Lagina\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z4l2nSgSxXMoND5TH8eRS1Uiqdx.jpg\"},{\"id\":35172,\"name\":\"Robert Clotworthy\",\"character\":\"Narrator (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3VSCCuiUapFIPodhCHaahltCs5r.jpg\"},{\"id\":2889997,\"name\":\"Gary Drayton\",\"character\":\"Self- Metal Detection Expert\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uknJfTcUFJ48zaNA2XQv6fCg2VH.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"JRqnoFYAiIg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"b_kVAK5JL2g\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"OvdQE3oYxqs\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":64592,\"title\":\"The Lost Tomb\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uqOqVGdNheWAXUhZcybOGA7aPuT.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2126760563380282,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":281207,\"title\":\"Rakkaudesta villieläimiin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kym7Q9ZSQByFHctlUTDTXar2KHU.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":10,\"seasonName\":\"Season 10\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Monumental tenth season. Connecting the dots one dig at a time.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/96heU9vu0bW1a5ByftZCVuLaaND.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-11-15\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"On Their Marks\",\"overview\":\"When the team returns to the island they find evidence of an underground tunnel and structure.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yptqLgh0BIiGmmTtbckRqNycR6v.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-15\",\"runtime\":82},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Across the Pond\",\"overview\":\"Marty, Alex, and Charles goes to England to explore leads that might connect the Knights Templar to the Oak Island mystery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/811Vu878T03eBWXW5uBE3kBGqP5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Bubbling Over\",\"overview\":\"The team explores the possibility of getting a member of the crew underground to investigate if the gold traces comes from a network of tunnels.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f5H9rjQYMWnvPFpqhwobF8ucJAz.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-29\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Wharf and Pieces\",\"overview\":\"The team is astonished when Gary unearths multiple artefacts in close proximity to the old ship's wharf and with the discovery of a shallower tunnel in the Money Pit, Marty's theory of an off-set chamber may finally be proven.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9G9UBWagoTxMuzlSatbutiNIARD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-06\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Duc it Out\",\"overview\":\"The discovery of mysterious ship logs provides more evidence that a 1746 French armada led by the Duc D'Anville landed on Oak Island; at the Money Pit, the team gets closer to getting a team member underground.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ko7vwJDZQe9XAiktsMMo9C8SGwO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-13\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Over the Muon\",\"overview\":\"Gary unearths a curious artifact on Lot 8 and in the Money Pit; the team is astonished to discover that they may be chasing multiple tunnels towards the gold in the garden shaft.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tPEeK1jQykKDhNWwihEpS7p2jrk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-20\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Norsing Around\",\"overview\":\"The team returns to the swamp and immediately uncovers more evidence of a sunken ship; in the money pit, the discovery of a collapsed structure could mean they have finally located the off-set chamber.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zo0P5BIqPWkRwhV9QykTKYqykxa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-03\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"A Lot to Be Desired\",\"overview\":\"The team's high hopes of finding the fabled treasure are intensified when they procure what could be the final piece of the puzzle.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sFUAjInuX07yiW019JTnuy2tiqc.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-10\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"A Damming Clue\",\"overview\":\"The fellowship is stunned when evidence suggests that a dam lies buried at the end of the swamp, corroborating both Fred Nolan's theory, and Zena Halpern's Templar map.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aO8Z9T0qUl8vNeCePN1XvFhUA1f.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-17\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Blob\",\"overview\":\"While the archaeologists work hard to uncover a new feature discovered on Lot 5, the scientists have finally identified the area where the gold is.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1P0LFvhwguSnPogfCKnrYfR6zfL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-24\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Oh, Well!\",\"overview\":\"While the team uncovers more evidence suggesting the mysterious man-made stone foundation on Lot 5 was purposefully hidden, the Fellowship is zeroing in on the gold in the Money Pit.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mYXWr4cqNg8s0wcpOki5X3NjtnF.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-01-31\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Beware the Blob\",\"overview\":\"While the team searches for clues to understand why an ancient well was constructed on Lot 26, excitement abounds when more evidence of a tunnel heading directly towards the garden shaft is discovered.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2uPUfhGhhelWHOTo5jPKaXI591O.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-07\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"All's Well\",\"overview\":\"As the Fellowship prepares to get a team member underground in the Money Pit for the first time, a new theory emerges suggesting that Nolan's Cross holds the secret to its exact location.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lQ76RdMDOLaJ8wose9Fp1ZndSrK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-14\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Getting the Shaft\",\"overview\":\"The team is ecstatic when new scientific evidence narrows down the location of the gold signature in the Money Pit. And Rick realises a lifelong dream when he finally gets underground on Oak Island.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j2l4rDDuvxvtXxOiZxEmyZpfyac.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-21\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Wood You Believe It?\",\"overview\":\"Confidence grows when irrefutable, scientific evidence reports the fellowship is closer than ever to the gold.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/guGk1DWIeA3OATwE4JGeTQbVUX2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-02-28\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Striking Gold\",\"overview\":\"The Fellowship is certain that they're closer than ever to an offset chamber when the probe drilling operation in the garden shaft finally gets underway.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oEjVrwDz9ZWHSfZZFYQQOi77xLR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-07\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"A Well of Secrets\",\"overview\":\"As the garden shaft operation gets deeper, the evidence of gold becomes stronger.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bvODy3qrytow3vy4NkiAkcYB9lA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-14\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"A Quadrilateral Move\",\"overview\":\"While the drilling operation gets closer and closer to its destination, the team is shocked when they discover evidence of an ancient safe.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/68PDusdMTuxtXwOwYBn9cQ2pGSt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-03-28\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Ramping Up\",\"overview\":\"After a long wait, the Fellowship gets permission to return to their excavation in the swamp; almost immediately, they make a discovery that could connect all the cobblestone dots in the mysterious bog.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/XtjJzUK43Z4cUOIHXHCfR0oVeB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-04\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"A Barrel full of Clues\",\"overview\":\"As time is running out, an exciting find in the swamp may have the fellowship rewriting the history of North America.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/280TqaLXAt9QkAB0rgHB3R2cvfY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-11\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Roman Around\",\"overview\":\"After a new find suggests that the Oak Island mystery could have ancient ties to Italy, the team investigates a stone structure that shockingly has a design that matches the original Money Pit treasure shaft.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yN8O4GIiZHxwS0alkpWC8iiTqTt.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-18\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Starry Knights\",\"overview\":\"The North Atlantic winter is quickly approaching but the stars are aligning for the fellowship of the dig when the swamp reveals more of its secrets, and a trip to Italy provides a shocking new insight into Nolan's cross.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A33nfxwU7JYb0ev4kFBvuFTls0c.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-04-25\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"The Italian Job\",\"overview\":\"While an incredible new discovery is made in the triangle-shaped swamp, Rick Lagina and members of the team make shocking connections in Italy between the Knights Templar and the Oak Island mystery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zC8zIfxYkIPckwy2aMejln4F4PV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-02\",\"runtime\":42},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Down the Hatch\",\"overview\":\"Rick, Marty and the team make a discovery below the Garden Shaft that could be the key to solving the Oak Island mystery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wqdAOQMRsIoyql8guPVEjjUiVkO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-09\",\"runtime\":41},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"And the Hits Keep Coming\",\"overview\":\"As new discoveries are uncovered in the triangle-shaped swamp and on Lot Five, the Oak Island team makes an incredible revelation in the Money Pit.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/Y2jtQPuM3d4O26Hv4a6tVHmoUs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2023-05-16\",\"runtime\":42}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2014-01-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}